@startuml ProposalA_TwoRepoSplit
title Proposal A - Two-Repo Split (snapshot 2026-05-20)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "PowerShell user\n(installs from Gallery)" as User
actor "GitHub viewer\n(community, future hire,\npartner you brief later)" as Viewer
actor "Keith\n(solo operator)" as Keith
actor "Future collaborator\n(CIO friend / accountant friend,\non engagement)" as Future

package "Public - visible to anyone on the internet" {
  cloud "GitHub repo: greenmtnsun/GitEasy" as PubRepo {
    component "Module code\n(Public/, Private/, Format/, manifest, psm1)" as Code
    component "Tests/, Examples/" as Tests
    component "README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, CONTRIBUTING" as Top
    component "docs/UML, docs/SECURITY-FINDINGS-*" as Docs
  }
  cloud "PowerShell Gallery" as PSG {
    component "GitEasy package (per release)" as Pkg
  }
}

package "Private - Keith only (until access granted)" {
  cloud "GitHub repo: greenmtnsun/GitEasy-internal\n(private)" as PrivRepo {
    component "Roadmap.md\nKnown-Bugs-and-Fixes.md\nDecision Records (DRs)" as Plan
    component "PROJECT_MANIFEST.md\n(internal philosophy)" as Manifest
    component "Dev tooling\n(Update-*Wiki.ps1,\nBuild-*UnitTests.ps1)" as DevTools
    component "AI session backups\n(.claude/, handoffs, scratchpads)" as AI
  }
}

User --> Pkg : install
User --> PubRepo : reads docs
Viewer --> PubRepo : reads README, CHANGELOG, code, UML
Keith --> PubRepo : commits releases
Keith --> PrivRepo : commits planning, DRs, scratchpads
Keith --> PSG : Publish-Module on release
Future ..> PrivRepo : invited on engagement\n(repo as share mechanism)

note bottom of PubRepo
  Pristine commit history. No internal
  planning content ever entered this repo.
  Anti-vibe brand carried by SECURITY-FINDINGS
  + CHANGELOG, not a public roadmap.
end note

note bottom of PrivRepo
  Full git history on planning + DRs.
  AI session data has cloud backup.
  Clean access-grant mechanism for collaborators.
end note

@enduml
